(2. Why must memory created with new[] be released with delete[] rather than delete?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(new[] creates an array allocation, so delete[] tells C++ to release the complete array) Tj
T*
(allocation correctly. Using delete on memory created with new[] is undefined behavior and) Tj
T*
(can cause incomplete cleanup or heap corruption.) Tj
T*
() Tj
