(An STL vector manages its own memory and automatically releases it when the vector leaves) Tj
T*
(scope. It also provides size\(\), checked access through at\(\), and standard algorithms,) Tj
T*
(reducing the risk of leaks, mismatched deallocation, and incorrect size tracking.) Tj
